Description: office productivity suite with OFD and batch printing
 LoongOffice is a full-featured office productivity suite with Writer, Calc,
 Impress, Draw, Math, Chinese localization, Chinese help, and the SDK.
 .
 This all-in-one package also contains the OFD reader extension and the batch
 print application and extension. The OFD extension requires a Java 17 capable
 runtime; batch printing uses the distribution Python and Qt 6 bindings.
